---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="MyBackHaul — fill your empty return legs">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 via-white to-blue-50">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-24">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-8">
          <svg class="w-9 h-9 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
          <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">MyBackHaul</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-6">
          Fill your empty <span class="text-blue-600">return legs</span>.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
          MyBackHaul matches distributors' loads with hauliers who have spare capacity on the way
          back — with a proof of delivery you can rely on, captured even where there's no signal.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
          <a
            href="/app"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full sm:w-auto bg-blue-600 text-white px-7 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-semibold shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/20 hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors"
          >
            Open the driver app
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="/guide"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full sm:w-auto px-7 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors"
          >
            How it works
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mt-16 sm:mt-24">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-gray-100 p-6">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Post a load</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Distributors post backhaul loads in seconds; the route is worked out automatically.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-gray-100 p-6">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 17a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM20 17a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16V6a1 1 0 00-1-1H4a1 1 0 00-1 1v10a1 1 0 001 1h1m8-1a1 1 0 01-1 1H9m4-1V8h4l3 3v5a1 1 0 01-1 1h-1" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Find a backhaul</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Hauliers browse loads on the way back and accept the one that fits their route.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-gray-100 p-6">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-green-100 text-green-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Proof of delivery</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Capture a photo, signature and recipient on delivery — it works with no signal and syncs later.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-center text-gray-500 text-sm mt-16">
        Built for UK haulage. Proof of delivery is recorded on the driver's device the moment it
        happens and delivered when signal returns.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
